<glyph name="M" format="2">
  <advance width="1021"/>
  <unicode hex="004D"/>
  <note>
A ribbon M with bowed uprights, soft shoulders and a cupped valley; no modular diagonals.
Weight master: 展示特粗：茎 214，但内白下限降到 0.34，上眼继续让位给下眼。M 的谷从最深点往回抬，避免封口。字距重新打开。
</note>
